<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Defs>
  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_LunarHeart</defName>
    <label>Lunar Ascendant</label>
    <description>A rare Lunar Ascendant commands five fast moonlit sword forms: Crescent Draw, Moonfall Step, Selene Dance, Falling Moon and Moonbreak Rush. Moonbrands strengthen finishing attacks; the rush retreats and returns against two nearby enemies. Above ordinary Ascendants in power, below Celestial. Broad silver shoulders, an indigo cloak, a crescent mask and Moonwake. Celestial Bestow grants Lunar with a 2% chance and fulfills Eclipse evolution milestones. Otherwise, Eclipse requires 150 mastery kills and ten Ascendant days. The minimum comfortable temperature is lowered by 40 C; psychic sensitivity is reduced by 25%.

Damage: this lineage multiplies the Melee damage stat by 2.3 (+130%). The shared 20% reduction makes an otherwise identical eligible physical melee packet 1.84 times its unascended value before armor and other modifiers. This is not a fixed skill-damage value: techniques scale from the current melee profile and use their own multipliers, marks and, where applicable, separate elemental hits. Do not apply the lineage multiplier a second time to the weapon profile.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_LunarAbilities" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_FlameRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>180</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>2</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_EclipseMastery" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>0.2</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Sight</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Hearing</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Breathing</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>BloodPumping</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>BloodFiltration</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Metabolism</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Talking</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Eating</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
        <painFactor>0</painFactor>
        <totalBleedFactor>0.25</totalBleedFactor>
        <naturalHealingFactor>6</naturalHealingFactor>
        <hungerRateFactor>0.6</hungerRateFactor>
        <restFallFactor>0.6</restFallFactor>
        <statFactors>
          <CarryingCapacity>5</CarryingCapacity>
          <MoveSpeed>2</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>2.3</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MeleeCooldownFactor>0.78</MeleeCooldownFactor>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>1.75</WorkSpeedGlobal>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.32</IncomingDamageFactor>
          <ImmunityGainSpeed>2</ImmunityGainSpeed>
          <JoyFallRateFactor>0.6</JoyFallRateFactor>
          <PsychicSensitivity>0.75</PsychicSensitivity>
        </statFactors>
        <statOffsets>
          <MentalBreakThreshold>-0.25</MentalBreakThreshold>
          <MeleeHitChance>4</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>12</MeleeDodgeChance>
          <ComfyTemperatureMin>-40</ComfyTemperatureMin>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
